OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AShould promotion depend on how workers
OL,4,Ause AI?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut if he uses AI to take care of two
OL,7,Fdays worth of work each week, he says
OL,8,Fthe financial rewards don't add up.
